            "body": "The W1 Square amplitude is capped at 0.50 Vpeak with zero offset. Scope captures 8,192 paired samples at requested 250 kS/s, then reads back the ACTUAL sample rate. CH1 identifies transitions; CH2 supplies fitted capacitor samples.",
            "tone": "Information"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "hardwareLimits",
          "type": "instruction_card",
          "text": "REQUIRED MEASUREMENT WINDOW",
